WEBVTT

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Ready... 1, 2, 3, GO!</i>

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:15.180
<i>Love life! Very! Very! Happy!</i>

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.970
<i>Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping!</i>

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.680
<i>Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK?</i>

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:23.640
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:29.280
<i>Rushing out onto the road to</i>
<i>school with the blue sky behind us</i>

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.240
<i>I like that! I like this, too!</i>

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.740
<i>I'll take it all, all of it~</i>

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.620
<i>A girl who imagines love is all romance</i>

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.370
<i>If I can attack, I'll do it boldly</i>

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:45.000
<i>Let's find an original vision for the future</i>

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:50.920
<i>Sometimes, we'll have a secret love advice time</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.760
<i>Who do you like?</i>

00:00:53.970 --> 00:01:01.310
<i>You've got a green light for love now!</i>
<i>It's your chance to move forward!</i>

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:02.140
<i>So, let's just</i>

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:05.140
<i>Have a blast! Fall in love!</i>

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.230
<i>Our youth is non-stop!</i>

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.320
<i>Run! Aim for the future!</i>

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:10.940
<i>Everyone gather</i>

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>For a happy ending!</i>

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:16.360
<i>Will tomorrow be happy or sad?</i>
<i>Will we idle our time away?</i>

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.450
<i>We'll work hard!</i>

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:21.740
<i>I want to keep dreaming forever!</i>

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.960
<i>Let's fly out into the</i>
<i>world with all our strength!</i>

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:29.840
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.010
Battle of the bands?

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:39.220
Yes. There's an old friend
of mine called Ogasawara...

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:44.230
His agency is trying to
promote an all-girl band...

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:51.150
How about it? Wanna pit your
Plasmagica against our Criticrista?

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.730
...is what he said!

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:58.200
Not like an idol group that just appeared
on the scene would be any competition!

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:01.660
I accepted the battle of the bands at S-River!

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:05.080
Is it really all right to accept so easily?

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:09.000
I haven't heard much good about his agency.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:11.380
Let's do it!

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.040
Huh?

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:16.510
As the new Plasmagica,
I think we should accept this!

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:18.340
What do you all think?

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:21.390
We haven't been able to play
with Cyan except during practice,

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:26.850
and most of all, I think it's a
good chance for us to level up!

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:27.940
Yeah, you're right!

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.600
I want to try, too!

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:30.980
I'm okay with it, too.

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:32.980
I agree, pyuru!

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.860
If you all say so...

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.070
Now that that's decided...!

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:43.330
Fortify yourselves with this.

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:48.460
Finally, my first concert!

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.500
Criti... crista...

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:56.760
It says they're special students in the
show business course in the middle school

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:59.220
at St. Midi Girls' Academy.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:01.220
Is that a big deal?

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:03.300
Cyan, you've never heard of it?

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:06.310
No, sorry...

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:09.690
For those who want to
make it in the music industry,

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:12.650
you could say that school
is the gateway to success.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.320
It says they're all friends
from the student council.

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.650
They seem really tight.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:22.620
Well, Rosia? How was that Plasmagica band?

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:25.280
How were they? About what?

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:33.290
What kind of band were they?
Were they sparkly? Or did they go "bang"?

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:37.420
Oh. I haven't heard them
play yet, so I don't know,

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.300
but they looked normal, I guess.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.550
I don't think we can look down on "normal."

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:46.600
No problem! We can beat 'em in a sec!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:58.530
About the concert hall in S-River
where we're having the battle of the bands...

00:03:58.730 --> 00:03:59.570
Hm?

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:04.410
Actually, that was where I first
resolved to become a pro musician.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:05.280
Really?

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:06.910
It's the first I've heard of it, pyuru!

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:13.670
The concert I saw that day left
a deep impression on my heart.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.250
If I close my eyes like this...

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:24.720
- I can see the wonderful guitar playing of that Grateful King vividly even now.
- Rock and roll!

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:29.890
Until then, music was
something I enjoyed listening to,

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:35.150
but that day, it became something
I enjoyed playing myself.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:39.400
S-River can be called
your starting point then, pyuru!

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:40.230
Wow...

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:45.360
Plasmagica is playing our first battle of
the bands in such an important place, huh?

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:49.450
Everyone, I'm counting on you.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:51.160
Yeah!

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:54.080
Well, good night then!

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:59.130
Oh, I can't wait until the battle of the bands!

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.300
Do you even know what
a battle of the bands is?

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:03.380
Huh?

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.640
I knew it. You were getting excited
without really knowing what it was.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.680
It's just what the words say!

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.430
It's a battle between bands!

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:13.930
A battle?!

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.310
It's a concert battle where
you bring your best songs!

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.320
A concert battle?!

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:21.980
Two bands duke it out in a concert hall,

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:26.910
where the audience there
judges who's more awesome.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:30.410
Then, the winner is decided with votes from
those watching on the big screens around town

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.660
and on the Internet.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:35.370
The excitement from the
audience turns into points,

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:39.500
and the Melodisian stones
of the winning band evolve.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.090
Really?

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:44.800
That's not all.
The winners also get sound dollars.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.050
Wow, that's amazing!

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:50.050
I see...

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:53.850
I'll work hard in my own way

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:56.060
to do the best I can at
my first concert with Plasmagica!

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.400
So I'm counting on you, Mr. Berry!

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.860
"Mr. Berry"?!

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:05.690
I mean, "Strawberry Heart"
is so long... and makes me stutter...

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:07.610
Do what you want.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:18.170
Two weeks left until the
battle of the bands, huh?

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.790
We don't have much time.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:27.340
After I finally got to join a band...

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:32.050
I always thought that
I wanted to join a band someday.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.930
Listen, you cattle!

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:42.020
We will polish our crimson souls even
more and stand at the top of Midi City!

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:47.950
- We're SHINGANCRIMSONZ!
- But more than that, I wanted friends to play music with.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.280
Are you interested in bands?

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.210
Hey.

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:01.880
This is who I am.

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:06.260
Banded Rocking Records...?

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:11.220
- They are also from my agency.
- I was the most popular today, too!

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.890
The dark sun god descends!

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:18.930
I was thinking of putting
together a girl band, too.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.900
I'm looking for members for that right now.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:22.980
A band?

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:23.980
How about it?

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:27.110
Will you let me hear that bass of yours?

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:32.700
S-Sure, but...

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.870
That's why when the president scouted me,

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.960
I thought it was a chance to make some friends.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.920
My name's Chuchu. Nice to meet you!

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.670
I'm Moa, pyuru!

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:50.840
I'm... Retoree... N-Nice to meet you...

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:54.180
Moa, I like what you did at the chorus!

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:55.640
Really, pyuru?

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:57.510
You were good too, pyuru!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:58.140
Thanks!

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:00.730
Well... I'm heading out now.

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:02.100
Huh?

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:05.810
Did we say something that
rubbed her the wrong way?

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:13.490
But I don't know how to be friends
with anyone, or how I should act with them.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:16.700
"Tight," huh?

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.500
Even though we've been
together for a while now,

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:23.920
I still haven't been able to
get close to Chuchu or Moa.

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:31.630
Pyuru-ru-ru, pyuru-ru-ru-ru...

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:45.520
If I don't send in an investigation
report on this planet soon,

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.610
they're going to think I'm slacking off, pyuru.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:54.450
If another investigator comes,
it'll be even worse, pyuru.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:09:00.370
But right now, I need to prioritize
winning the battle of the bands, pyuru.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:04.410
I can do the report after that, pyuru...

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.920
Which means, good night for now, pyuru.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.680
To stand at the top of the music world one day.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:18.970
Yes, that is my goal—no, my ambition.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:23.480
I would do anything to make that come true.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.560
Even if that means...

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:34.820
Hey, Mr. Berry, what do you think
I need to do to win the battle of the bands?

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:38.160
Is the most important thing
to win against the other band?

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:40.160
Huh? It's not?

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:42.490
Isn't that what the battle is for?

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.710
Well, you'll see once you try it.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:56.470
Hey, Mr. Berry...

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:58.640
Huh?

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:01.010
What, again?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:05.980
Jeez, he always stops
answering when I need advice...

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:12.730
Agonize over it and slowly
polish your skills. If you don't...

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.610
Tomorrow's finally the day!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.660
I played everything correctly,
and I think it sounds good overall!

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.160
I didn't make any mistakes, either.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:24.200
We can do this, pyuru!

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.540
Cyan, is something wrong?

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.250
Huh? Uh, um...

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:34.380
It's true that no one made any mistakes, but...

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:38.180
I can't say it, meow...

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:40.390
One! Two! Three! Four!

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:46.020
Plasmagica, please get ready for rehearsal.

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.190
Everyone, let's go!

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:58.110
♪ Resounding no matter when, forever ♪

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.410
♪ These feelings won't stop ♪

00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:01.660
Yay!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.870
They're really good, pyuru!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:09.370
No, it's beyond the level of
whether they're good or not...

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:13.090
They're Criticrista...?

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:17.420
Oh, it's Plasmagica! Good morning!

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:20.470
Oh, nice to meet you. We're—

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.180
I know who you are!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:25.510
You're Chuchu, Retoree, Moa...

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:29.180
...and the new member, Cyan. Right?

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:31.100
Forgive me for not introducing myself earlier.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:33.980
I'm the bassist, Holmy.

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:35.570
Nice to meet you.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.740
I'm the drummer, Jacklyn!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.610
Nice to meetcha!

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:43.120
I'm Tsukino. I play keyboard.

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:44.950
I like smooth red bean paste.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:48.580
Oh, Tsukino! Talking about food again?

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:51.870
Oh! I'm Rosia! I sing and play guitar.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:54.750
Nice to meet you, big sisters!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:57.630
What's with this aura...?

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.800
This kid... She's good...

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.380
Hello, Maple!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:03.930
Ogasawara!

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:07.390
You're just a beginner egg as usual.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:08.770
That is just how I'm built!

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:13.350
- Besides, the ladies at the New-Bridge food shops think I'm a dear—
- What do you think of the abilities of our band?

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:17.150
Hmph! They're not much. Our Plasma—

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.860
Oh, right.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:22.780
We've actually already decided
to give the girls a major label debut.

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:28.240
They'll be popular in no time,
earning lots of sound dollars for us!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:33.420
The value of music cannot
be measured by sound dollars!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:36.630
Huh? Are you still saying that?

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:40.710
That is what I believe.
That's why I left Dagger's agency!

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:42.380
If you think about those girls—

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:44.220
I don't need advice from you!

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:47.850
The paths before us are different.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:50.850
Can we go now?

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:53.980
Yeah, rest up before the real thing!

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.810
Okay!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:13.620
Rehearsal didn't go as well as
we wanted, but the real thing will—

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:17.000
That's our true ability right now.

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:18.840
There's no way we can win.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.050
If you say that before a battle,

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.590
we won't even be able to win
battles we should've won, pyuru!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.680
We have no hope of winning.

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:29.140
We can't win against girls who are classmates.

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:32.020
Retoree, that doesn't have
anything to do with the battle—

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.600
It does!

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:36.560
It does...

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.570
But... that's my fault...

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:44.440
Retoree? What do you mean?

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:54.650
I mean... It's because I still keep my
distance from everyone after all this time...

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.830
Wh-What should I do?

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.500
I understand your uneasiness, Retoree.

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:02.170
I feel the same way, too!

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:06.130
But if we lose our nerve here,
we won't be able to accomplish anything.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.930
Weren't we going to perform at BooDooKan?

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.850
BooDooKan?

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:14.310
That's just a dream of a dream.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:18.730
If we lose here tonight,
we might even lose that dream.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.650
Stop that nonsense!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:26.030
Where are you going? Wait!

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:28.700
I'm going home...

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:31.830
- Huh?!
- Pyuru-ru-ru-ru-ru!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.410
I don't want to lose disgracefully and get hurt.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.540
That's irresponsible!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:40.710
I don't care if you feel that
way about me. It's not like...

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:46.050
It's not like we were able
to become friends, anyway...

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.600
Cyan?

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:03.320
Um... Retoree... Will you listen for a sec?

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:08.780
Now, here's volume seven
of the battle of the girl bands!

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:12.120
Today will be a battle between these bands—

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:16.910
First up, from St. Midi Girls' Academy,
where only the chosen can enter—

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:21.080
Current students and super huge newcomers...

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.670
Criticrista!

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.670
- Rosia!
- Holmy!

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.170
- Jacklyn!
- Tsukino!

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:27.460
One!

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:27.800
Two!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:28.090
Three!

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.590
Four!

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:36.470
♪ Thanks for waiting ♪

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:37.310
♪ It's SHOW TIME! ♪

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:40.140
♪ We'll perform in a cute way ♪

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.190
♪ We'll make your heart race ♪

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:42.980
♪ SHOW ROCK! ♪

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:45.070
♪ Eat up tonight, too ♪

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:48.230
♪ That's right, I want to feel
you next to me more and more ♪

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.950
♪ I'm sure, I'm sure our
hearts will grow closer fast ♪

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.870
♪ Etched-in feelings that make my heart throb ♪

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:55.240
♪ Yes! (Yes!) Yes! (Yes!) ♪

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:56.330
♪ They won't stop ♪

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:57.990
♪ More! Yeah! (Yeah!) Yeah! (Yeah!) ♪

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.790
♪ Let's sing! Yeah! (Yeah!) Yeah! (Yeah!) ♪

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:05.000
♪ I wanna lift my voice so it rings across town ♪

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.550
♪ This melody of ours ♪

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.340
♪ More! Dance! (Dance!) Dance! (Dance!) ♪

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:12.220
♪ Let's dance! Whoo! (Whoo!) Whoo! (Whoo!) ♪

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.510
♪ We're caught up in it ♪

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:16.100
♪ Rushing all over the world ♪

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:22.270
♪ Resounding no matter when, forever ♪

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.650
♪ These feelings won't stop ♪

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.020
Yay!

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:31.740
Next, we have the girls
from Banded Rocking Records,

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:35.120
who recently got a
new member and powered up!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:38.200
The new... Plasmagica!

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.830
My first... concert!

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:59.600
I had an idea... for the chorus part.

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.890
What do you think about this?

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.730
L-Like this?

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.980
Yeah, that'll be cooler!

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.610
R-Really?

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:12.320
♪ I'm fine even by myself ♪

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.610
Then, should I do this?

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:15.780
♪ That's what I thought ♪

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:16.820
♪ But the next thing I knew ♪

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:17.660
Wow! Then, what if we added this chord here...?

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:19.990
♪ Noise spread in my heart ♪

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:20.200
Wow! Then, what if we added this chord here...?

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.700
♪ ...I was pretending to be strong ♪

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:24.250
♪ I couldn't find the courage ♪

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:26.710
What about me? What should I do, pyuru?

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:27.330
♪ To take that first step ♪

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.210
What do you think of this?

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:30.130
♪ To take that first step ♪

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:30.800
♪ Wandering around in a maze ♪

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:32.800
Sounds good, pyuru!

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.470
♪ My heart is astir ♪

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:37.430
I'm getting through to everyone!

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:40.510
♪ The destiny I suddenly came into contact with ♪

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:44.640
♪ The melodies of the two of them that resonated ♪

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:51.780
♪ The strength that even made me forget I was looking down ♪

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:55.030
♪ Just as long as you're there ♪

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:56.740
♪ I can be strong ♪

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:59.240
♪ I won't hesitate anymore ♪

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.280
♪ I can see it now ♪

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:01.620
They're good.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:03.580
Almost as good as me.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:07.540
♪ We're there, in the future ♪

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:23.560
Okay, everyone!
Now, which band was more awesome?

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:26.430
Keep those votes coming!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:34.610
Now, who will be the winner?!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:37.700
Cyan, that was a wonderful arrangement!

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:40.780
Why didn't you tell us about it sooner, pyuru?

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:45.540
Um, sorry... It was hard
to find a chance to tell you...

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.210
Why is that?

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:50.540
Um... I wonder...

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:54.250
I think I understand how you feel, Cyan.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:03.050
Whatever the case, thanks to Cyan,
this was our best performance ever!

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:05.220
I agree, pyuru!

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:08.140
I don't think I did anything...

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:10.520
I'm sure it was the music—

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.230
We have the results!

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:17.190
What's the verdict? Who's the winner?

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:24.160
The winner is Criticrista!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:31.080
Oh, no! I thought we lost for sure!

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.500
As if.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.920
No, it's our loss.

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:39.630
Only for today!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.300
Let's work hard next time, pyuru!

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:43.260
That girl...

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:50.560
Cyan... Thanks...

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:57.110
It's nothing. Like everyone said,
I should've told you all sooner.

00:19:57.320 --> 00:20:00.570
But, it was hard to get it out...

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:05.950
I'm really introverted, so there are a lot
of things I can't put into words properly...

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:09.700
I don't really have any friends...

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:12.670
But today, I thought—

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:17.750
With my bandmates,
I can use music instead of words.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.840
That's enough to get through to them!

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:24.840
Did that sound lame?

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:26.510
Of course not.

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:28.310
Oh, good!

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:31.430
Oh, dear. We lost, huh?

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.100
No evolution for our Melodisians, either.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.400
But I feel a sense of accomplishment, pyuru!

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.270
Yeah, that's true!

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:40.360
Next time, we will definitely win!

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:41.900
Of course!

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:44.410
We've got to practice again starting tomorrow.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:45.820
Yeah.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:54.460
I think I might finally
be able to make friends...

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:03.380
Wow, Criticrista's only in middle school?
They're younger'n us!

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:05.010
Must be nice to be young.

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:09.510
Amazin'! I mean, that's real impressive!
And they sure are cute...

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:12.810
It must be the environment.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.440
Environment?

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:17.860
Like we won't make it unless we're in Midi City.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:21.730
That's not true! Music's like the sun—

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:24.570
It shines equally on everythin'!

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:26.410
Right, Hakkun?

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:31.200
Yeah... But I want to go to Midi City...

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:35.160
Sorry! Classical Japanese is the pits!

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:37.250
Huh? What's wrong, guys?

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:40.040
I wanna go to Midi City!

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.010
Oh, Midi City's great!

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:43.420
Wanna go?

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:45.880
Anyway, there's an
amazin' band there right now!

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:47.720
Huh? What band?

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:52.220
Tsurezurenaru Ayatsuri Mugenan!

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:53.980
They're seriously like gods of music!

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:03.900
<i>If you like it, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:04.110 --> 00:22:06.780
<i>You can do it because you like it</i>

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:09.490
<i>The feeling that you like music</i>

00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:12.870
<i>Can't be stopped by anyone</i>

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:21.290
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:23.500
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:27.050
<i>Running through my body</i>

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:29.590
<i>This electric thrill</i>

00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:34.600
<i>Is this feeling curiosity?</i>

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:38.140
<i>Negativity is a decrescendo</i>

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:40.810
<i>Hope and expectations, a crescendo</i>

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:46.360
<i>Show off our passion and</i>
<i>get god to be our ally, too</i>

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:51.870
<i>I wanna share with everyone and have a taste of</i>

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:55.580
<i>Big!! Rocking!! Heart-throbbing!! Happiness!!!!</i>

00:22:56.580 --> 00:22:59.620
<i>If it's you, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:02.630
<i>You can do it because it's you</i>

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:07.720
<i>Let's try performing these</i>
<i>dream-colored notes together</i>

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:10.930
<i>I want to tell you directly</i>

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:13.760
<i>A life-sized, "heart-sized" heart</i>

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:16.640
<i>In order for it to reach you...</i>

00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:19.980
<i>I will sing with all I have</i>

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:22.730
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:24.690
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:30.860
How wonderful! To travel around
the world to spread your own music!

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:32.620
I want to be able to do that!

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:34.580
It's true—traveling's nice.

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:36.450
Hot springs, mountain streams, stewed giblets,

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:40.710
grilling some fish with warm sake on
the side, with a pretty young hostess—
